# Play Store release signing key — never commit this. Losing it means
# this app can never be updated on the Play Store again under the same
# listing; leaking it means anyone who has it can publish updates that
# look like they come from you. Back the whole keystore/ folder up
# somewhere private and durable (a password manager, an encrypted drive)
# outside of git.
/keystore/*.jks
/keystore/*.properties.local
